WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.838
Every danger here has a guard.

2
00:00:01.838 --> 00:00:06.574
The quiet one is counting the wrong owners,
a guest, a bot or someone who's left,

3
00:00:06.574 --> 00:00:10.012
so the gate passes on people
who can't answer for the app.

4
00:00:10.012 --> 00:00:14.524
The loud ones are a disable on a guess
and a delete, and the code answers both:

5
00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:18.962
nothing is disabled without the
officer's confirmation and a fresh look,

6
00:00:18.962 --> 00:00:20.737
and there is simply no delete.

7
00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:23.108
A plan changed after review won't run,

8
00:00:23.108 --> 00:00:26.426
and the write path can't
send anything but a disable.

9
00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:31.540
Notice, again, that each guard is a
rule the code enforces every time.
